"dkodo52ezog0","created":1786681323909,"text":"产品边界与定位","layout_mind_offset":{"x":63.58334283075391,"y":-1311.166636649106}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkodpicvuvc0","created":1786681431204,"text":"面向的客户"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodxdc6owg0","created":1786682047191,"text":"要解决的问题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkodxukznao0","created":1786682084729,"text":"我们的边界：哪些是我们做的，哪些不是我们做的"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe7izc01s0","created":1786682843117,"text":"我们遇到的技术难点是什么"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe9wxvqzs0","created":1786683030232,"text":"你们产品的核心模块是什么"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe25qnia00","created":1786682422473,"text":"核心考察：对产品的理解；产品的核心模块；系统边界的设计；模块化的能力；能否区分已经实现和未来规划。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe7yjgkgo0","created":1786682876985,"text":"为什么选择模块化单体而不是微服务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoe87fsm200","created":1786682896355,"text":"当前实现和未来扩展的边界在哪里"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodr7106y80","created":1786681563270,"text":"一条Lead的处理线，直到\"WAITTING_APPROVAL\"","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-8.499987818300866,"y":-674.0000004470348}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoeiilu8rc0","created":1786683704307,"text":"为什么还需要将传来的Event转换成内部的lead"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoeirzizts0","created":1786683724725,"text":"如何确保不重新计算HubSpot的判断"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoej0pf3fk0","created":1786683743705,"text":"状态机崩溃之后如何继续呢？"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoej64ucds0","created":1786683755522,"text":"为什么系统还要进行一次normalization和dedupe"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoejw08lmo0","created":1786683811840,"text":"考察知识：Domain model 与 Provider model 隔离；\nsource of truth；\nstate machine；\nnormalize / dedupe；\nimmutable evidence；\nresumable processing；\n当前主路径和历史兼容路径的区别。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodrt5jwo00","created":1786681611434,"text":"从人工审批到再次进入OutBox\n异步执行：从OutBox到Provider Adapter\n从Adatper到真正产生外部副作用","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-975,"y":-258},"layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoella3hug0","created":1786683945219,"text":"如果有两个用户同时审批怎么办","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoelxzc5fs0","created":1786683972867,"text":"如果前端重复的点击approve怎么办","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoem4twfvk0","created":1786683987776,"text":"为什么审批时不直接调用 HubSpot？","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoenilm1a00","created":1786684096114,"text":"配置在审批后变化怎么办？","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoenjyhapc0","created":1786684099069,"text":"审批权限在哪里检查？","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoeoaqcfvc0","created":1786684157350,"text":"考察知识：Idempotency key；\noptimistic locking；\nCAS update；\nstale write；\nhuman-in-the-loop；\nimmutable execution snapshot；\n权限检查；\nAudit before/after。","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodukveo2g0","created":1786681828499,"text":"崩溃恢复：成功，重试，与未知结果","layout_mind_offset":{"x":832.5000012293458,"y":1919.000000745058}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoeo1o1ark0","created":1786684137619,"text":"外部Provider的失败场景有多种：\n明确尚未执行\n明确失败\n可能已执行但结果未知\n已成功但本地未完成","layout_right_offset":{"x":11,"y":-204},"font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoez9y7www0","created":1786685017655,"text":"Timeout 为什么不能直接 retry","layout_right_offset":{"x":32,"y":-197}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoezcoe3340","created":1786685023591,"text":"DLQ replay 和 reconciliation 有什么区别","layout_right_offset":{"x":52,"y":-52}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoezjt8pig0","created":1786685039122,"text":"Provider 已创建 Task，但响应丢了怎么办","layout_right_offset":{"x":35,"y":-24}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoezrb3gog0","created":1786685055439,"text":"人工确认没有执行后，为什么可以 retry","layout_right_offset":{"x":18,"y":-268}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoezvsca9k0","created":1786685065189,"text":"晚到成功结果怎么办","layout_right_offset":{"x":70,"y":-60}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkof03rah7k0","created":1786685082539,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkoep1k1yio0","created":1786684215742,"text":"OutBox Worker","layout_mind_offset":{"x":565,"y":646}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoephhifjk0","created":1786684250417,"text":"业务：可靠的把数据库中的执行任务交给异步的worker；\n并且能够实现多worker并发，worker的崩溃接管；\n持久化的重试；\nlane隔离；\nDLQ","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16},"font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoeqgppt080","created":1786684327101,"text":"多个worker如何避免处理同一个事件","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoequ025v40","created":1786684356024,"text":"如果worker处理期间崩溃怎么办","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoer3c7pc80","created":1786684376350,"text":"为什么需要lock token,租约到期之后旧的worker恢复怎么办","layout_right_offset":{"x":662.749998677522,"y":-20.999999925494194}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoes30yhwo0","created":1786684454034,"text":"如何避免一个慢Provider阻塞全部任务","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoesd3mzso0","created":1786684475964,"text":"retry为什么要持久化，而不是sleep();","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoesrlpcgw0","created":1786684507531,"text":"考察知识：Transactional Outbox；\nat-least-once delivery；\nSKIP LOCKED；\nlease；\nfencing token；\nbounded executor；\nbackpressure；\nexponential backoff 与 jitter；\npoison message；\nDLQ。","layout_right_offset":{"x":574,"y":-16}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkoeuvncmyw0","created":1786684673066,"text":"外部副作用执行","layout_mind_offset":{"x":29,"y":761}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkoevj57gkg0","created":1786684724212,"text":"业务作用；将已经批准的FirstActionPlan安全的转换为：\nHubSpotCRM task;\nGoogle calendar Meeting;\nManual Task;","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":44}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoewmynuco0","created":1786684810887,"text":"为什么HTTP调用不放在数据库事务里","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":44}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoewzcuoyw0","created":1786684837867,"text":"generation、token、connection epoch 分别解决什么？","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":44}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoexa7i4pc0","created":1786684861488,"text":"Provider 成功后本地崩溃怎么办","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":44}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkoexj7723s0","created":1786684881060,"text":"外部副作用；\ndistributed transaction；\nexecution fencing；\ngeneration/token；\nstale worker；\nlate result；\nshort transaction；\nProvider adapter / gateway；\nambiguous outcome；\nexactly-once 的现实限制。","layout_right_offset":{"x":-31,"y":44},"font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkodv1esn4g0","created":1786681864500,"text":"Recovery 与控制塔输出","layout_mind_offset":{"x":593.2499984167516,"y":1219.9999994784596}},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}